            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isbarbardhigga WHO ee da'da la saxay wuxuu ka bilaabmaa taariikhda dhalmada la filayey. Cabbirkan weli waa kaydsan yahay."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
